    "art1": "the three HAM meshes move 0 px at BOTH poses with movers in AND out, controls green (null 0, allOff 812,634-827,908) — added. Prop_Equipment_Cart moves 3 px at ROOM and is KEPT. CoffeeMugBlenderKit newly reads 0 px at ROOM but is a keeper at SCREEN, so the union keeps it, which is the rule this file already states.",
    "art2": "2026-10-06: the original floor lamp replaced Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp (#75). Its five noCast names Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp_4, Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp_5, Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp_6, Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp_7, Prop_Vintage_Floor_Lamp_8 left with it. Re-measured over the new lamp's three casters at ROOM and SCREEN, movers in AND out, controls green (null 0; allOff 805,927-805,964 ROOM, 197,487-197,980 SCREEN): Prop_Floor_Lamp_1 (the red body) moves 6 px at ROOM and is KEPT; _2 (Equipment_Dark: neck, collar, lip) and _3 (the shade's reflector) move 0 px alone and 0 px together at both poses - added. _4 (glas) does not cast, as the old glass did not."
